      "created_at": "2025-02-13T12:24:38.160Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is also Steam’s trading card-related art, which works pretty nicely for wallpaper purposes. There’s a wiki of that here: <a href=\"https://steamtradingcards.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Sentinels_of_the_Multiverse\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Category:Sentinels of the Multiverse | Steam Trading Cards Wiki | Fandom</a></p>\n<p>The Sentinels of the Night pics could be turned into decent wallpaper with a bit of cropping or background-adding: <a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Sentinels_of_the_Night\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinels of the Night - Sentinel Comics Wiki</a></p>",
